      "notes": "Bass-led D-dorian funk. Clav notes are 67ms chord stabs, not sustained melody. DPCM backbeats occur on beats2/4; triangle octave pops and ghost snares displace the sixteenth grid. Only this track has a bass/drum count-in. C# prepares A7. Raw levels, no normalization. DPCM hits are explicitly choked: kicks after three ticks, snare at one or two ticks by rate. These short percussion articulations prevent sample overlap and leave the noise voice to supply the tail.",
